      "settings": {
        "eyebrow": "Ovulation is a metabolic event",
        "heading": "Inositol for Fertility:\nThe Studies",
        "subtext": "Ovulation is metabolic. High insulin pushes the ovaries toward androgen production and disrupts the signals that mature and release an egg. That's why an insulin-sensitizing molecule became one of the most-studied supplements for ovulatory function.*",
