        "background_heading": "Study Background",
        "background_text": "The gold standard of research, applied directly to ovulation: 42 women with PCOS were randomly split — one group took myo-inositol, the other a placebo, and nobody, not even the researchers, knew who had which until the end (Costantino et al., 2009).†",
